Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: LDAP Connection Failed

Verify LDAP server is running: sudo systemctl status slapd
Check LDAP connectivity: ldapsearch -x -H ldap://127.0.0.1:389 -b "dc=example,dc=com"
Verify bind credentials in Vault configuration
Issue 2: Authentication Succeeds but No Policies Applied

Check group membership in LDAP: ldapsearch -x -b "cn=developers,ou=groups,dc=example,dc=com"
Verify group filter configuration in Vault
Ensure group mappings are correctly configured: vault read auth/ldap/groups/developers
Issue 3: Token Permissions Denied

Verify policy syntax: vault policy read developers
Check token policies: vault token lookup
Ensure paths in policies match secret paths
Issue 4: Vault Server Not Responding

Check Vault server status: vault status
Verify Vault server process: ps aux | grep vault
Check Vault logs for errors
